@startuml C2_VVE_Update_Logical
title C2 – VVE Update (Logical Containers)
left to right direction

node "Client Browser" as Browser {
  component "PLMS SPA" as Spa
}

node "PLMS Backend" as Backend {
  component "TodoApi" as TodoApi
}

node "OEM Platform" as Oem {
  component "Vve API" as VveApi
  database "VVE Store" as VveStore
  database "VVN Store" as VvnStore
  component "Audit Producer" as AuditProducer
}

node "IAM" as Iam

Spa --> TodoApi : HTTPS PATCH /vves/{id}
TodoApi --> Iam : Token validation
TodoApi --> VveApi : Forward update
VveApi --> VveStore : Update VVE + timestamps
VveApi --> VvnStore : Fetch planned dock
VveApi --> AuditProducer : Publish VVE_UPDATED
VveApi --> TodoApi : Updated VVE + warnings
TodoApi --> Spa : JSON response
Spa --> Browser : Refresh UI state

@enduml
